<title>USA: Lufthansa Cargo names new Dallas manager.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Cargo names new Dallas manager.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo said Todd Hildreth has been appointed cargo manager at Dallas/Fort (DFW) with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Hildreth will be responsible for all sales and marketing for the airline's DFW operation, which includes North Texas, New Mexico, Oklahoma and Louisiana, a company statement said.</p>
<p>He replaces Klaus Paul, who has retired after 37 years with Lufthansa.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
